-- GenChem Ch10 (Acids & Bases) — Batch 3 of 4: Titration & Titration Curves + Buffers / Henderson-Hasselbalch
-- 24 questions, all confidence >=4 (verified vs OpenStax Chemistry: Atoms First 2e + standard MCAT references; every calculation independently re-computed).
-- Cross-batch + cross-chapter deduped; final dedup audit PASS (0 genuine conflicts) after the systematic recall-answer-leak sweep.
